            "prompt": "Paint a finished portrait 4:5 storybook puzzle illustration, 1280x1600 target: a cozy outdoor spice stall with copper bowls and patterned cloth sacks, close three-quarter view. Dimensional warm hand-painted digital illustration, tactile grain and woven textiles, intricate but readable natural details, soft upper-left sunlight, delightful sophisticated mobile game art. Dominant golden yellow ochre on large awning and plaster wall and the light warm market ground, tiny turquoise/red accents. No landmark, city name, text, labels, people, logos, border, UI or watermark. Stall table at lower center with beautifully distinct paprika, turmeric, pepper and cinnamon displays. A broad simple golden canvas awning stretches across the upper third with visible support beam; leave most of its lower hem plain, no pennants or tassels yet. Put an empty small cream bud vase with visible open neck on the table's right corner around x84%, y72%. Put a small understated clay pot with short bare branch at left x13%,y57%, no leaves on that one. One tied kraft-paper spice package at table front near x46%, y69%, no decorative bow on it. Fill every surface naturally, no holes or empty placeholder boxes. Clean background will later receive five independently painted details: one fabric pennant attached below the upper beam, one awning tassel, one flower sprig in the little vase, a leafy sprig rooted in the left pot, and a bow on the kraft packet. Omit those specific foreground details now, but retain all physical attachment supports.",
