            "prompt": "Production transparent PNG atlas of EXACTLY FIVE hand-painted sprite cutouts in a3-column by2-row grid; bottom-right cell entirely empty. Real alpha transparency, no background/backdrop, no checkerboard painted, no letters, borders or numbers. Each object well inside cell, at least60pixels transparent gutter around entire sprite. No sprite crosses cell midpoint or image edge. Dimensional softly brushed storybook illustration, warm sunlight upperleft, delicate tactile details, not vector or photo. Separate elements for a golden ochre spice market: TOPLEFT one small saffron and muted teal triangular fabric pennant, horizontal sewn edge at top and pointed tip down, slightly windcurled; TOPMIDDLE one narrow ochre braided awning tassel with top attachment loop and frayed soft end; TOPRIGHT a tiny purple lavender sprig on a slender long green stem, bare bottom end for a vase; BOTTOMLEFT a single graceful olive-leaf sprig with a long exposed woody bottom stem for a claypot; BOTTOMMIDDLE a small cream cotton string bow tied to a kraft spice packet, loops spread sideways, short tailsdown, gently elevated threequarter view. No pot,vase,awning,packet or surroundings. Objects preserve natural shape and full silhouette.",
