            "prompt": "Create ONE small cotton string bow, a detailed warm storybook painted sprite with real transparent alpha PNG background. Two loose sideways loops, central knot and two short tails hangingdown, slightlyelevatedthreequarterview. Warm cream unbleachedfibers, sunlightupperleft, softpaintedshading, very delicate slimtwine, natural irregularhandtied shape. ONLY the bow. No bag, package, paper, knot support, wood, table, shadowmatte, frame, textorcheckeredbackground. Centerbowinimage with huge transparentmargin. This standalone detail will be composited onto an existing small kraftpaper spice packet.",
